{"id":"n49229-1-9","stage":3,"title":"세트 · 套装","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n49229-1-9-1","ko":"가구들이 디자인이 각각 달라서 서로 안 어울려.","zh":"这些家具的设计各不相同，所以搭配在一起不协调。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"가구들이","meaning":"家具","explanation":"가구：家具；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"가구","audio":"/audio/7cd1a55d13c114f1190b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62492","senseId":"1","lemma":"가구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가구들이","audio":"/audio/e0b553d6a137b3c4b316.mp3"}},{"text":"디자인이","meaning":"设计","explanation":"디자인：设计；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"디자인","audio":"/audio/a333d62d9be4e2be66d3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"54448","senseId":"1","lemma":"디자인","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"디자인이","audio":"/audio/d79c280a70803455388b.mp3"}},{"text":"각각","meaning":"各，各自","explanation":"각각：各，各自","readings":[{"term":"각각","audio":"/audio/364a9ead20c1ccaa0ada.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29233","senseId":"1","lemma":"각각","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"각각","audio":"/audio/364a9ead20c1ccaa0ada.mp3"}},{"text":"달라서","meaning":"不同，不一致","explanation":"다르다：不同，不一致；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"다르다","audio":"/audio/1db38b4e543bc73e4860.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26824","senseId":"1","lemma":"다르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"달라서","audio":"/audio/3f48b24e370a59ad7bc1.mp3"}},{"text":"서로","meaning":"互相，相互","explanation":"서로：互相，相互","readings":[{"term":"서로","audio":"/audio/fbeb53408bcf7039778f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66374","senseId":"1","lemma":"서로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"서로","audio":"/audio/fbeb53408bcf7039778f.mp3"}},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}},{"text":"어울려.","meaning":"谐调，相配，般配","explanation":"어울리다：谐调，相配，般配；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"어울리다","audio":"/audio/e3eff4fbd4afe320fdac.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67048","senseId":"4","lemma":"어울리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어울려","audio":"/audio/12c688c61bc1ff3e7d19.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"7cd1a55d13c114f1","term":"가구","zh":"家具","audio":"/audio/7cd1a55d13c114f1190b.mp3","entryId":"62492","definition":"家庭用的工具，如床、衣柜、餐桌等。","pronunciation":["가구"]},{"id":"a333d62d9be4e2be","term":"디자인","zh":"设计","audio":"/audio/a333d62d9be4e2be66d3.mp3","entryId":"54448","definition":"服装、工业产品、建筑等具有实用目的的作品设计或图案。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"364a9ead20c1ccaa","term":"각각","zh":"各，各自","audio":"/audio/364a9ead20c1ccaa0ada.mp3","entryId":"29233","definition":"每一个单独地。","pronunciation":["각깍"]},{"id":"1db38b4e543bc73e","term":"다르다","zh":"不同，不一致","audio":"/audio/1db38b4e543bc73e4860.mp3","entryId":"26824","definition":"两个对象相互不一样。","pronunciation":["다르다"]},{"id":"fbeb53408bcf7039","term":"서로","zh":"互相，相互","audio":"/audio/fbeb53408bcf7039778f.mp3","entryId":"66374","definition":"两个以上缔结关系的对象相对于各自的对方。","pronunciation":["서로"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"e3eff4fbd4afe320","term":"어울리다","zh":"谐调，相配，般配","audio":"/audio/e3eff4fbd4afe320fdac.mp3","entryId":"67048","definition":"相互自然地达到和谐。","pronunciation":["어울리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/b0a7f36fbbc0b91fb90f.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n49229-1-9-2","ko":"한꺼번에 세트로 살 걸 그랬나?","zh":"当初是不是应该一次性成套买的呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"한꺼번에","meaning":"一下子","explanation":"한꺼번에：一下子","readings":[{"term":"한꺼번에","audio":"/audio/4901a1242719de241339.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72431","senseId":"1","lemma":"한꺼번에","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceR